<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue: Yo! FINALLY made it, huh?\rI wasn’t in the mood at Cinnabar, but\nnow I’m ready to scrap you.\r...\rYou tellin’ me you ran through ALL\nthe Blocks in Johto?\rHahaha! Heh!\fJohto’s Blocks that WEAK?\rAyo, don’t trip. I’ll know if you good\nby scrappin’ you right now.\fI used to be KINGPIN. For like a\nhour.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue: No WAY!\rHow the HECK I lose to YOU?!\r...\rTch, aight...\fDon’t tell my sister.\fHere, take this. It’s the Earth\nChain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Earth Chain from Blue!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue: With this Chain, you can\nuse the HM move Parkour!\fHere!\rTake this too!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue: It’s got Slow Mo!\rIt let slower homies move\nbefore faster homies for a while.\rIt’s a real tricky move, ain’t it?\nJust like me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blue: ...\rAight, I was wrong. You the REAL\ndeal. You a good Hustler.\rBut I’ma beat you someday. Don’t you\nforget it! Smell ya later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, future legend!\rThe floor here unstable, so put away\nyour homies...NOW!\rThe Block Boss scrapped the Kingpin\nthree years ago. Lost. But he\fscrapped him!\rHe ain’t no pushover. Give it\neverythin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Man, you DEADASS tough...\rThat was SO inspirin’.\nI got tears in my eyes. Real ones.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, future legend!\rThe floor here unstable, so put away\nyour homies...NOW!\rThe Block Boss scrapped the Kingpin\nthree years ago. Lost. But he\fscrapped him!\rHe ain’t no pushover. Give it\neverythin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Viridian City Block\nThe Boss Ain’t Here. Again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0454_T02GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Viridian City Block\rBlock Boss: Blue\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
